      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <h2 id="comparison" class="scroll-mt-24">How It Compares</h2>
        <p>
          The T3 doesn't exist in a vacuum — here's how it stacks up
          against two of the strongest home-brand alternatives at a
          significantly lower price.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 text-left">
              <th class="p-3 font-black text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-200">Model</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-black text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-200">Motor</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-black text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-200">Deck</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-black text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-200">Incline</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-black text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-200">Price</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {COMPARISON.map((row, i) => (
              <tr class={`${i < COMPARISON.length - 1 ? "border-b border-gray-100" : ""} ${row.highlight ? "bg-[#0F62FE]/5" : ""}`}>
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-gray-900">{row.name}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gray-600">{row.motor}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gray-600">{row.deck}</td>
